						<p class="Tbody" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:10pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-10pt;widows:1;"><a href="#T106">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements</a></p>
					</td>
